-- Grape notes, round 3, strong part (product owner, 2026-11-23: "kan je
-- verder gaan met de wijn rondes?"): Germany, Austria, Portugal, Australia,
-- the United States, New Zealand, South Africa, Chile and Argentina.
-- Two independent organisations per claim.
-- Region statements fill only fields still empty in production and stop
-- the whole file if any field was no longer empty; local_note is then
-- rewritten from the three fields for builds up to 1.9.0 (48). Keyed on
-- ids, never on names. Sources per row: round3_*.csv beside this file.
